AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_38070> "A drug used for the treatment or prevention of cardiac arrhythmias. Anti-arrhythmia drugs may affect the polarisation-repolarisation phase of the action potential, its excitability or refractoriness, or impulse conduction or membrane responsiveness within cardiac fibres.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_38070> "anti-arrhythmia drug")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_38070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35554>)

